# Copy to .env and fill in. NEVER commit .env — only this example file ships.
#
# This gateway needs no configuration: the note store is in memory.
#
# When you swap in a real backend, declare its variables here by NAME with no
# value, and list the same names in component.json under mcp.auth.envVars.
# The portal REJECTS any manifest containing something that looks like a
# credential — names only, always.

# DATABASE_URL=
# API_KEY=
